cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Citation metadata is provisional. Confirm contributor attribution and add
  release and repository details with the maintainer before formal citation.
type: software
title: 'ARGUS: Evidence-constrained agentic reasoning for noncoding regulatory variant interpretation'
authors:
  # Provisional collective attribution; replace with maintainer-approved authors.
  - name: ARGUS contributors
abstract: >-
  ARGUS combines DVR transcription factor binding predictions with a
  deterministic investigation using ADASTRA, JASPAR, and ENCODE cCRE,
  deterministic verification and abstention/stopping rules, an optional
  Anthropic planner restricted to allowed evidence actions, and prose reporting
  from fixed evidence facts. AlphaGenome Atlas is evaluated separately as a
  computational cross-reference and is not yet integrated into the loop.
keywords:
  - noncoding regulatory variants
  - transcription factor binding
  - evidence-constrained reasoning
  - agentic reasoning
